---
source: tests/snapshots/cli_output.rs
expression: normalize_output(&output.stdout)
---
Agent-first issue tracker (SQLite + JSONL)

Usage: br [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  watch     Watch a prefix for bead events (and inbox messages by default)
  msg       Send an ephemeral message to another prefix (e.g., `bd msg arc1 "ping"`)
  who       List agents currently watching for messages (active `bd watch` heartbeats)
  inbox     List received messages (or show a specific message in full)
  outbox    List sent messages
  blocked   List blocked issues
  search    Search issues
  list      List issues
  show      Show issue details
  create    Create a new issue
  q         Quick capture (create issue, print ID only)
  update    Update an issue
  comments  Read or append an issue's comments (append-only attributed history)
  close     Close an issue
  reopen    Reopen an issue
  defer     Defer issues (schedule for later)
  undefer   Undefer issues (make ready again)
  dep       Manage dependencies
  admin     Power-user / diagnostic commands (init, dash, graph, stats, sync, ...)
  version   Show version information
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --db <DB>     Database path (auto-discover .beads/*.db if not set)
      --json        Output as JSON
  -v, --verbose...  Increase logging verbosity (-v, -vv)
  -q, --quiet       Quiet mode (no output except errors)
      --no-color    Disable colored output
  -h, --help        Print help
  -V, --version     Print version
